# Copy the current token from .runtime/session.token into your HTTP client's
# private environment as `token`. Do not commit it. Server must be running.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Public health: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Missing token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system

### Wrong token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system
Authorization: Bearer invalid

### Protected metadata: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### OpenAPI: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/openapi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validate metadata, without creating or executing state: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"SCENARIO","id":"river-crossing"}

### Unsupported version: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schemaVersion":2,"kind":"COMMAND","id":"order-1"}

### M1: create a blank draft; save returned id as scenarioId and version as draftVersion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"空白地图","width":7,"height":5}

### M1: import the complete versioned preset (save returned id/version)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../scenarios/river-valley.json

### Read editable draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/{{scenarioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export plain scenario JSON (can be imported verbatim)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/{{scenarioId}}/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Freeze; save returned id as revisionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/{{scenarioId}}/revisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":{{draftVersion}}}

### Run twice to create two independent READY instances
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revisionId":"{{revisionId}}","seed":42}

### Inspect frozen input and hash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revisions/{{revisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect instances from this revision
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revisions/{{revisionId}}/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read structured editing events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/{{scenarioId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Frozen revision cannot be modified: 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/revisions/{{revisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
